     "label": "例 3",
     "ref": "Tutorial Terms",
     "question": "Explain: Journal Entries, Trade Discount, Discount Allowed, Discount Received, Purchase Returns, Sales returns, Bad debts, Drawings (revision).",
     "solution": "<strong>Journal Entries</strong>：按时间顺序在普通日记账里记录交易的借贷分录，含日期、账户、金额和摘要。\n<strong>Trade Discount</strong>：商业折扣，买卖时直接在发票上减价（大量购买、老客户），<strong>不入账</strong>，按折后价记录。\n<strong>Discount Allowed</strong>：给客户的现金折扣（提前付款），是费用，Dr Discount Allowed、Cr Accounts Receivable。\n<strong>Discount Received</strong>：从供应商得到的现金折扣，是收入，Dr Accounts Payable、Cr Discount Received。\n<strong>Purchase Returns</strong>：退回供应商的货，Dr Accounts Payable（或 Cash）、Cr Purchase Returns。\n<strong>Sales returns</strong>：客户退回的货，Dr Sales Returns、Cr Accounts Receivable（或 Cash）。\n<strong>Bad debts</strong>：收不回的应收账款，是费用，Dr Bad Debts、Cr Accounts Receivable。\n<strong>Drawings</strong>：所有者从企业拿走现金或存货自用，减少所有者权益，Dr Drawings、Cr Cash。",
     "numeric": false
